  these come from the insiders the  scoopers the leakers and the news about  toby maguire and andrew garfield is  coming from those same leakers and this  news pretty much states that sony does  indeed have plans for andrew garfield  and toby maguire now sony does have more  plans for andrew garfield than toby  mcguire of course because of their age i  think toby maguire was fantastic in  spider-man knowing home it was amazing  to see my favorite spider-man on screen  again but he is a little bit older now  that doesn't mean that he can't appear  in some movies and heck i'd still give  him his own movie but it seems as of  right now sony wants him to appear in  other projects in their sony spider-man  universe possibly keeping their  multiverse going with madame webb which  we'll talk about in just a bit but of  course the question that everybody has  been asking me about is what exactly is  happening with the amazing spider-man 3  is there a possibility that it could get  made with angie garfield and the answer  is quite simply yes according to things  that we've heard recently and insiders  sony does indeed want andrew garfield  back they want him to play a decent part  at least in their spider-man universe  sony needs a spider-man in their  universe and sony in marvel studios made  it pretty clear that that spider-man  wasn't really going to be tom holland  now they teased us that it was going to  be tom holland in that post-credits  scene for venom let there be carnage  where eddie brock and venom make their  way to the mcu but sadly we know that  that was just kind of to hype up no way  home even more than it was already hyped  up because quickly not too long after  that we saw the post-credits scene for  spider-man no way home where we saw  eddie brock and venom again but they  left the mcu back to the sony universe  but they left a piece of the symbiote  behind telling us that tom holland is  going to go up against a different venom  symbiote that is not tom 