verse in the sony universe  obviously we have the multiverse within  the mcu but sony wants to do that within  their own universe with all of their  characters like craven the hunter venom  and it all comes down to madame webb  madame webb is filming right now and if  you don't know anything about madame  webb there's one really important thing  that you need to know about her well two  one is that she is essentially a cosmic  entity in marvel comics and two she can  travel the multiverse she has the  ability to travel through universes and  apparently madame webb is supposed to be  a really big movie for sony's spider-man  universe and that makes sense  considering the fact that she can travel  through other universes this is actually  a perfect setup for andrew garfield  spider-man and toby maguire spider-man  to stick around even if they don't get  their own movies they can still go to  their respective universes and we can  get them back on screen from what we've  heard it seems like this kind of fits  into their plan of tobey maguire  returning and cameoing in movies but not  getting his own while on the other hand  it's been said that andrew garfield is  going to play more of a prominent role  in sony spider-man universe possibly  getting his own movie and possibly going  up against tom hardy's venom in venom 3.  tom hardy confirmed that venom three is  indeed going to be him going up against  spider-man before venom let there be  carnage came out he said that that was  ultimately the end goal for the next  film and he's already teased us after  venom let there be carnage has come out  teasing us that he is still indeed going  up against spider-man and that just  makes sense and the post-credit scene  for venom let there be carnage he said  maybe i should go find the spider-man  guy now he's back in his own universe  but he should probably still go find  spider-man that's probably what he's  thinking because he did just travel  through another universe he's probably  going to have some questions so the  amazing spider-man 3 is definitely on  the table for andrew garfield to return  and make but at this point in time i am  expecting to see andrew and toby  probably in a few projects on the sony  spider-man universe and then hopefully  they both show up for avengers secret  wars now as far as spider-man 4 in the  mcu with tom holland is concerned like i  mentioned kevin feige and amy pascal did  say that they are already working on  spider-man 4. no we have not heard  anything from tom holland but i think  that tom holland has learned that he  can't spoil stuff anymore but both  studios have pretty much already stated  that yes he's coming back zendaya and  jacob battle on as well plus let's not  forget that they did indeed tease venom  in the mcu in the post-credits scene for  knowing home granted it's a different  venom than tom hardy's but he was teased  nonetheless they might have not signed a  new contract yet which is why we haven't  heard much but since sony and marvel  studios both said they have plans for a  spider-man 4 i'm assuming he'll  definitely be coming back and let's not  forget this exciting piece of  information avengers secret wars is  actually where spider-man runs into the  venom symbiote for the very first time  in the comics it's the first time that  we see spider-man wear the black  symbiote suit so who knows maybe in  spider-man 4 spider-man gets the venom  symbiote but doesn't give it away and  maybe he'll go on to have that suit  still in secret wars so that is pretty  much all the information we know so far  about all three spider-man and the two  different spider-man universes the mcu  and the sony spider-verse of course if i  hear anything else i'll be sure to let  you all know and do a video on it so be  sure to subscribe so you don't miss out  on any of the latest spider-man news  don't forget to like the video and for  live updates you can always follow me on  instagram and twitter as always thank  you all so much for watching woof  you

